{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026wnbh9veJug1795188979.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>長沙灣一個地盤下午發現戰時炮彈，由警方檢走，無人受傷。</p><p></p><p>現場是興華街3號一個地盤，警方下午近一時接獲工人報案，稱發現懷疑炸彈。警員到場後，發現一枚二戰時期英式迫擊炮彈，長約24厘米，直徑約5厘米。爆炸品處理課人員將炮彈檢走，並將其安全處理。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.BOMB-2200.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026rfzHUfKChX1795188987.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T16:24:27.195735+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T15:26:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T17:53:58.239794+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T16:17:39.731084+00:00","content_hash":"659f80ca22c4beec46c8785a13723e04d575e0c87fa37dca24652c43595bd4e7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T16:24:27.195735+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}